1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:01,555
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,557 --> 00:00:03,019
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,021 --> 00:00:04,021
(Episode 74)

4
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:06,777
Don't take Seung Woo's words to heart.

5
00:00:08,275 --> 00:00:11,293
I'm afraid he'll get stubborn
if I say anything.

6
00:00:12,372 --> 00:00:15,613
Apparently, it's best not to interfere
when it comes to relationships.

7
00:00:16,752 --> 00:00:19,305
Does he actually have feelings for Do Hee?

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,189
I don't know yet.

9
00:00:22,751 --> 00:00:24,438
You've been through a lot,

10
00:00:24,812 --> 00:00:27,970
but Seung Woo struggled too
after injuring his leg.

11
00:00:29,211 --> 00:00:32,238
I'm so ashamed to face you.

12
00:00:33,261 --> 00:00:34,580
I'm sorry on his behalf.

13
00:00:38,525 --> 00:00:39,606
How about a sweet pancake?

14
00:00:39,974 --> 00:00:41,461
Sweets help at times like this.

15
00:00:42,726 --> 00:00:43,726
Okay.

16
00:00:45,598 --> 00:00:48,273
- Thanks.
- Enjoy.

17
00:00:48,697 --> 00:00:49,907
This rice cake shop is new.

18
00:00:50,456 --> 00:00:51,744
Welcome.

19
00:00:52,756 --> 00:00:56,104
- I didn't expect to see you here.
- Hello.

20
00:00:56,412 --> 00:00:58,929
- Is your mom doing well?
- Yes.

21
00:00:59,466 --> 00:01:01,892
- What would you like? A sweet pancake?
- Yes.

22
00:01:01,941 --> 00:01:03,043
Just a moment.

23
00:01:17,405 --> 00:01:19,980
Honey, Ji Hu still isn't back?

24
00:01:20,558 --> 00:01:22,283
He's probably just running late.

25
00:01:22,992 --> 00:01:24,556
I bet he's in Seo Chon again.

26
00:01:24,558 --> 00:01:26,093
Why don't you call him?

27
00:01:32,285 --> 00:01:33,285
It's me.

28
00:01:33,309 --> 00:01:34,530
Ji Hu!

29
00:01:36,158 --> 00:01:38,669
I thought you went to Seo Chon again.

30
00:01:38,671 --> 00:01:39,862
I said I'd come home.

31
00:01:40,065 --> 00:01:41,065
Dad.

32
00:01:41,067 --> 00:01:42,963
I'm glad you're here. Welcome back.

33
00:01:43,224 --> 00:01:44,906
- Did you have dinner?
- I'm fine.

34
00:01:44,908 --> 00:01:46,995
No, you need to eat. Honey.

35
00:01:47,185 --> 00:01:48,709
Okay. I'll take care of it.

36
00:01:49,872 --> 00:01:51,600
- I'll leave my bag upstairs first.
- Okay.

37
00:02:00,285 --> 00:02:01,311
How have you been?

38
00:02:01,734 --> 00:02:03,955
Ji Hu. So you're back home now?

39
00:02:04,172 --> 00:02:06,033
Yes, the trial's over, so I should be.

40
00:02:06,035 --> 00:02:08,787
Good to see you.
I heard the news. Congratulations.

41
00:02:09,121 --> 00:02:11,636
- Thank you.
- Does your mom know? Is she happy?

42
00:02:11,665 --> 00:02:12,891
Yes. I greeted her downstairs.

43
00:02:12,918 --> 00:02:15,049
You need to be here.

44
00:02:15,051 --> 00:02:17,407
You're the gentleman of the house.
You keep your mom happy.

45
00:02:17,409 --> 00:02:18,409
Me?

46
00:02:19,858 --> 00:02:21,847
- You must've had a tough time.
- Not just me.

47
00:02:22,158 --> 00:02:24,694
Yeong Ju had it much harder.

48
00:02:27,478 --> 00:02:28,478
Thank you.

49
00:02:36,451 --> 00:02:38,033
That was quick.

50
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:39,858
Thank you. It looks delicious.

51
00:02:40,145 --> 00:02:41,747
You said goodbye properly, right?

52
00:02:41,749 --> 00:02:42,749
Yes.

53
00:02:43,018 --> 00:02:44,747
Don't go to that house again.

54
00:02:44,938 --> 00:02:46,861
I heard you slept in the living room.

55
00:02:46,971 --> 00:02:49,146
Who makes a guest sleep there?

56
00:02:49,147 --> 00:02:50,226
I liked it.

57
00:02:50,518 --> 00:02:52,872
- Everyone was good to me.
- Good to you?

58
00:02:53,121 --> 00:02:55,984
If I invited Ji Ni over
and made her sleep by the front door,

59
00:02:55,986 --> 00:02:57,549
would her family stand for it?

60
00:02:57,552 --> 00:02:58,552
- Honey.
- Mom.

61
00:02:59,419 --> 00:03:01,328
Don't forget why I went there.

62
00:03:01,692 --> 00:03:04,400
I left because Do Hee moved in.
It was because of the trial.

63
00:03:04,402 --> 00:03:05,989
Yes, that's true.

64
00:03:06,118 --> 00:03:07,846
Okay, I understand. Eat.

65
00:03:15,245 --> 00:03:18,147
Who is it? Call them back after dinner.

66
00:03:18,186 --> 00:03:19,186
Just a moment.

67
00:03:20,586 --> 00:03:21,586
Yes, Mother.

68
00:03:27,705 --> 00:03:28,913
It must be Ji Ni's mom.

69
00:03:29,031 --> 00:03:30,856
Can't she even let him eat?

70
00:03:31,465 --> 00:03:33,552
Don't get so worked up.

71
00:03:34,878 --> 00:03:36,918
- What are they talking about?
- I'm home now.

72
00:03:37,054 --> 00:03:40,572
- I just got in.
- You just got in?

73
00:03:41,011 --> 00:03:43,169
I heard you left Ji Ni in the afternoon.

74
00:03:43,815 --> 00:03:46,182
I went back to the office
to finish my work.

75
00:03:46,725 --> 00:03:49,288
- Did something happen?
- No. I just...

76
00:03:49,290 --> 00:03:51,412
wanted to check that you got home.

77
00:03:51,818 --> 00:03:54,830
Ji Ni hates it when I question her
about everything.

78
00:03:55,322 --> 00:03:59,007
Next time you're late
or have something else planned,

79
00:03:59,134 --> 00:04:01,066
let me know, just between us.

80
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,565
Reporting when I come and go?

81
00:04:02,872 --> 00:04:05,571
I wouldn't call it reporting.

82
00:04:05,696 --> 00:04:08,098
Just make sure Ji Ni doesn't worry.

83
00:04:08,152 --> 00:04:11,913
When you're dating, it's good to know
where they are and what they're doing.

84
00:04:13,425 --> 00:04:14,425
Understood.

85
00:04:14,712 --> 00:04:16,780
Okay. Have a good night.

86
00:04:17,207 --> 00:04:18,207
Goodbye.

87
00:04:19,841 --> 00:04:20,841
Wait...

88
00:04:21,072 --> 00:04:24,330
Is Ji Ni's mom making you report
when you get to work and when you leave?

89
00:04:24,925 --> 00:04:26,645
Has that woman lost her mind?

90
00:04:26,718 --> 00:04:28,382
You're her son-in-law, not her husband.

91
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:31,184
You're not even her son-in-law yet!

92
00:04:31,225 --> 00:04:33,816
Why should you have to report to her?

93
00:04:33,818 --> 00:04:35,263
Because she doesn't trust me.

94
00:04:35,448 --> 00:04:36,448
Why wouldn't she?

95
00:04:36,465 --> 00:04:38,759
The case to annul my marriage just ended.

96
00:04:39,412 --> 00:04:40,604
Trusting me can't be easy.

97
00:04:41,898 --> 00:04:44,697
She only accepted me
because Ji Ni likes me.

98
00:04:45,165 --> 00:04:46,998
So don't think too badly of her.

99
00:04:47,592 --> 00:04:49,902
Honey, am I the unreasonable one?

100
00:04:50,511 --> 00:04:51,825
Does this make any sense?

101
00:04:51,931 --> 00:04:53,679
It's not that I don't understand,

102
00:04:54,055 --> 00:04:55,705
but I think she's taking it too far.

103
00:04:55,778 --> 00:04:56,778
Dad.

104
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:59,746
I made Ji Ni a mistress,
even if only briefly.

105
00:05:00,311 --> 00:05:02,256
It's natural for her mom to be sensitive.

106
00:05:02,257 --> 00:05:03,355
Fair enough.

107
00:05:03,805 --> 00:05:05,601
What's fair about it?

108
00:05:05,602 --> 00:05:07,292
She's crossing the line.

109
00:05:07,558 --> 00:05:09,303
She's not even his mother-in-law yet.

110
00:05:09,305 --> 00:05:12,405
At this rate, he'll be under her thumb.

111
00:05:12,407 --> 00:05:13,736
It doesn't bother me.

112
00:05:14,498 --> 00:05:16,358
Mom, don't worry. I'll be fine.

113
00:05:16,925 --> 00:05:19,291
I think she's still shaken up
by what happened with Do Hee.

114
00:05:19,292 --> 00:05:20,948
Do you plan to get married right away?

115
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,627
Absolutely not.

116
00:05:25,498 --> 00:05:28,066
You've only just started dating properly.

117
00:05:28,185 --> 00:05:31,505
Take your time getting to know each other.

118
00:05:31,578 --> 00:05:33,453
You only knew her from afar before.

119
00:05:33,455 --> 00:05:37,596
Once you get closer, you might find
you have differences.

120
00:05:37,598 --> 00:05:38,667
Right, honey?

121
00:05:39,002 --> 00:05:41,392
Well, that's true.

122
00:05:42,532 --> 00:05:43,937
You should take your time...

123
00:05:43,939 --> 00:05:46,402
I'd like to marry her soon,
as long as she's ready.

124
00:05:47,038 --> 00:05:49,307
Of course, if she wants more time,
I'll respect that.

125
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:50,566
But that's what I want.

126
00:05:51,338 --> 00:05:53,111
It's always about Ji Ni.

127
00:05:54,484 --> 00:05:56,313
That friend, Jung A, right?

128
00:05:56,694 --> 00:05:59,702
Why don't you bring her and Tae O...

129
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:02,524
and spend some time here together?

130
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,251
- Jung A?
- Yes.

131
00:06:04,445 --> 00:06:06,998
Ji Ni might feel uneasy coming by herself.

132
00:06:07,325 --> 00:06:12,372
You could all come over,
have a meal, and talk.

133
00:06:12,374 --> 00:06:15,877
It'll give Ji Ni and me a chance
to get to know each other naturally.

134
00:06:16,177 --> 00:06:17,763
Okay. I'll try to arrange it.

135
00:06:18,546 --> 00:06:19,804
You've changed, Mom.

136
00:06:21,025 --> 00:06:24,041
You like her. What choice do I have?

137
00:06:24,362 --> 00:06:25,362
I have to change.

138
00:06:26,109 --> 00:06:27,305
Thank you, Mom.

139
00:06:27,538 --> 00:06:29,505
You'll like her once you get to know her.

140
00:06:30,442 --> 00:06:31,442
Okay.

141
00:06:32,251 --> 00:06:34,442
- Go inside and have dinner.
- Okay.

142
00:06:50,912 --> 00:06:53,031
What are you searching so hard for?

143
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,880
What?

144
00:06:55,927 --> 00:06:56,927
What's wrong?

145
00:06:57,419 --> 00:06:58,748
Did someone steal your hidden cash?

146
00:06:59,053 --> 00:07:01,202
Since when do I keep any hidden cash?

147
00:07:03,045 --> 00:07:05,403
- My wedding ring.
- What?

148
00:07:05,568 --> 00:07:09,482
I'm sure I put it right here
when I was clearing out Do Hee's things.

149
00:07:12,198 --> 00:07:15,931
Could the cleaners have knocked it
somewhere while cleaning?

150
00:07:16,748 --> 00:07:17,991
Or...

151
00:07:18,698 --> 00:07:21,116
I think someone took it.

152
00:07:22,172 --> 00:07:24,009
I should've kept it on.

153
00:07:24,317 --> 00:07:25,430
It's fine.

154
00:07:25,892 --> 00:07:26,992
We can buy another one.

155
00:07:27,492 --> 00:07:30,225
They say losing your wedding ring
is bad luck for your marriage...

156
00:07:31,185 --> 00:07:33,635
Don't say things like that.

157
00:07:34,127 --> 00:07:37,025
I'm sorry.
I should've taken better care of it.

158
00:07:40,552 --> 00:07:41,853
It's okay.

159
00:07:42,457 --> 00:07:45,653
You're stressed enough about Seung Woo,

160
00:07:45,822 --> 00:07:47,006
so forget about the ring.

161
00:07:48,218 --> 00:07:51,522
I'm trying so hard not to call him.

162
00:07:51,751 --> 00:07:54,006
I keep wanting to ask where he is
every 30 minutes.

163
00:07:55,697 --> 00:07:56,878
Don't do that.

164
00:07:57,632 --> 00:07:59,281
Do as Seung Hyun suggested.

165
00:07:59,365 --> 00:08:00,709
Stay out of it for now.

166
00:08:02,452 --> 00:08:03,856
That idiot.

167
00:08:05,925 --> 00:08:07,589
- I talked to her.
- What did she say?

168
00:08:07,838 --> 00:08:09,646
Will she talk to Ji Hu for me?

169
00:08:13,158 --> 00:08:15,088
Anyway, give it time. Goodbye.

170
00:08:17,729 --> 00:08:19,012
(Do Do Hee)

171
00:08:20,292 --> 00:08:23,134
Are you my wife? Why are you watching me?

172
00:08:23,325 --> 00:08:26,144
If I were your wife,
I'd have ripped all your hair out.

173
00:08:27,258 --> 00:08:29,290
I told her to apologize to Ji Ni
and go away.

174
00:08:29,405 --> 00:08:30,763
That's what I was telling her.

175
00:08:31,213 --> 00:08:32,213
Good.

176
00:08:33,033 --> 00:08:34,325
You owe Ji Ni an apology too.

177
00:08:35,482 --> 00:08:37,813
- Me?
- Didn't you ask her to forgive Do Hee?

178
00:08:38,132 --> 00:08:39,814
What right did you have to ask that?

179
00:08:43,418 --> 00:08:45,344
I didn't know it was that bad.

180
00:08:45,832 --> 00:08:46,832
But Dad...

181
00:08:48,011 --> 00:08:49,607
that man saved her.

182
00:08:49,818 --> 00:08:53,131
When I had my accident,
he didn't even get out of the car.

183
00:08:53,411 --> 00:08:55,351
It brought all my resentment back.

184
00:08:55,898 --> 00:08:58,121
- I didn't tell her, though.
- Why bring that up now?

185
00:08:58,578 --> 00:09:00,881
Do Hee creeps me out even more
for doing that to her.

186
00:09:01,285 --> 00:09:03,035
What middle schooler does that?

187
00:09:03,238 --> 00:09:04,721
That's not normal behavior.

188
00:09:05,091 --> 00:09:07,026
Please stay out of
other people's business.

189
00:09:07,565 --> 00:09:09,722
What do you think drove Ji Hu
to threaten to press charges?

190
00:09:10,265 --> 00:09:11,931
She even tried to run Ji Ni over
with her car.

191
00:09:12,285 --> 00:09:13,858
Does she think going to England
will make it all go away?

192
00:09:14,058 --> 00:09:15,849
I can't even forgive
that motorcycle accident.

193
00:09:17,438 --> 00:09:19,824
- I'm not letting that go.
- I said I got it.

194
00:09:20,616 --> 00:09:23,757
Honestly, you're even more stubborn
than O Reum.

195
00:09:24,412 --> 00:09:27,079
You're acting weird too.
Are you my brother or Ji Ni's?

196
00:09:27,081 --> 00:09:28,690
Want to know? Should I tell you?

197
00:09:28,814 --> 00:09:30,610
Forget it. Don't tell me.

198
00:09:32,165 --> 00:09:33,165
Have you eaten?

199
00:09:34,058 --> 00:09:35,179
I'm not hungry.

200
00:09:35,212 --> 00:09:37,188
You'd have to be crazy
to want to eat right now.

201
00:09:40,318 --> 00:09:42,373
So is he telling me to eat or not?

202
00:09:56,256 --> 00:09:57,880
That looks delicious.

203
00:09:58,204 --> 00:09:59,572
Did you make all this?

204
00:10:00,709 --> 00:10:01,709
Yes.

205
00:10:02,634 --> 00:10:03,634
Hey.

206
00:10:05,179 --> 00:10:06,970
I'm sorry about yesterday.

207
00:10:09,732 --> 00:10:12,718
I think I stuck my nose
where it didn't belong.

208
00:10:12,932 --> 00:10:16,730
I shouldn't have jumped to conclusions
without knowing the whole story.

209
00:10:19,272 --> 00:10:21,761
I had a lot on my mind last night too.

210
00:10:22,885 --> 00:10:27,198
I thought Dad wasn't himself
when you had your accident.

211
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,111
I thought he'd been a coward.

212
00:10:30,852 --> 00:10:32,303
I always feel bad
about what you two went through.

213
00:10:33,872 --> 00:10:34,872
Don't.

214
00:10:34,992 --> 00:10:39,043
Let's not blame ourselves for things
that were beyond our control...

215
00:10:40,598 --> 00:10:42,548
or say things that hurt each other.

216
00:10:43,445 --> 00:10:46,901
We're not from their generation, are we?

217
00:10:48,805 --> 00:10:49,805
First,

218
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,924
let me apologize.

219
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:54,644
What exactly is going on
between you and Do Hee?

220
00:10:55,406 --> 00:10:57,486
- Why do you ask?
- I'm worried about you.

221
00:10:58,289 --> 00:11:00,308
- Your mom...
- I know Mom's worried.

222
00:11:01,226 --> 00:11:02,402
I'll handle it.

223
00:11:06,758 --> 00:11:08,141
Did you already leave?

224
00:11:08,247 --> 00:11:09,313
Did you have breakfast?

225
00:11:09,899 --> 00:11:11,135
What did you eat?

226
00:11:11,478 --> 00:11:12,655
Mom, come eat.

227
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:15,371
Good. Okay.

228
00:11:15,616 --> 00:11:17,312
Good luck today too.

229
00:11:18,078 --> 00:11:20,003
Ji Hu's already on his way to work.

230
00:11:20,005 --> 00:11:22,690
Why are you keeping tabs on him?
Are you his girlfriend?

231
00:11:23,217 --> 00:11:25,615
I'm doing it for you
because you can't be bothered.

232
00:11:25,711 --> 00:11:27,872
Don't. I hate that kind of thing.

233
00:11:28,442 --> 00:11:31,632
You have to, whether you like it or not.
He's yours, so take care of him.

234
00:11:31,645 --> 00:11:33,958
People will take advantage of you
if you let your guard down.

235
00:11:34,085 --> 00:11:36,250
What makes Ji Hu any different?

236
00:11:36,398 --> 00:11:39,918
You haven't even made it official.
What if he falls for someone else?

237
00:11:40,018 --> 00:11:41,321
Then there's nothing I can do.

238
00:11:41,322 --> 00:11:42,783
They say love is
like a car accident, right?

239
00:11:42,785 --> 00:11:45,870
That's why you have to keep checking
that everything's safe.

240
00:11:45,872 --> 00:11:48,279
Keep him on his toes.
Let him know, "I'm watching you."

241
00:11:48,341 --> 00:11:51,122
If you're going to give Ji Hu a hard time
like you did my dad, stop right now.

242
00:11:51,392 --> 00:11:53,146
If you keep this up,
I'll break up with him.

243
00:11:53,645 --> 00:11:56,144
So you don't love him?

244
00:11:56,245 --> 00:11:57,870
How can you break up
over something like this?

245
00:11:57,872 --> 00:11:59,585
- Is it really that easy?
- Mom.

246
00:11:59,586 --> 00:12:01,432
What's love
without a little possessiveness?

247
00:12:01,572 --> 00:12:05,252
I'm making sure he only has eyes for you.
What's wrong with that?

248
00:12:05,365 --> 00:12:07,243
I'll handle it myself.

249
00:12:07,245 --> 00:12:10,059
I'll do things my way,
not with you keeping me on a leash.

250
00:12:10,725 --> 00:12:11,966
Don't do this again.

251
00:12:13,658 --> 00:12:15,615
- Breakfast is ready.
- You scared me.

252
00:12:16,647 --> 00:12:18,166
Seriously!

253
00:12:18,167 --> 00:12:20,733
That girl has no idea how the world works.

254
00:12:22,498 --> 00:12:26,079
Don't come thanking me later.

255
00:12:30,192 --> 00:12:32,100
That's the kind of mom I am.

256
00:12:32,539 --> 00:12:34,435
I only care about her.

257
00:12:43,992 --> 00:12:45,845
You should've sold it
when gold prices were high.

258
00:12:46,065 --> 00:12:47,845
They're a little low now.

259
00:12:48,380 --> 00:12:49,569
I know.

260
00:12:49,692 --> 00:12:52,271
My child is suddenly getting married.

261
00:12:52,584 --> 00:12:53,584
I see.

262
00:12:53,985 --> 00:12:56,716
At today's rate,
it's worth a little over 100,000 dollars.

263
00:12:56,718 --> 00:12:59,256
I've transferred it to the account
you gave me.

264
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:01,246
- Please check.
- Okay.

265
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:05,132
(+108,000 dollars)

266
00:13:05,438 --> 00:13:08,003
Yes, it's been deposited. Thank you.

267
00:13:08,004 --> 00:13:09,004
Yes.

268
00:13:09,616 --> 00:13:11,905
- Have a good day.
- Goodbye.

269
00:13:18,192 --> 00:13:19,827
Have you had lunch, Mother?

270
00:13:20,425 --> 00:13:22,723
I'm waiting for Ji Ni
so we can eat together.

271
00:13:23,410 --> 00:13:24,507
Just reporting in.

272
00:13:24,638 --> 00:13:26,221
All clear on the Ji Hu front.

273
00:13:30,238 --> 00:13:31,700
The Ji Hu front?

274
00:13:31,989 --> 00:13:33,514
Hey, are you happy?

275
00:13:33,900 --> 00:13:34,900
Very.

276
00:13:36,872 --> 00:13:38,789
- Let's finish this after lunch.
- Sounds good.

277
00:13:40,872 --> 00:13:42,219
Let's all break for lunch.

278
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:44,333
What should we eat?

279
00:13:44,645 --> 00:13:46,318
Spicy pork or pork cutlet?

280
00:13:46,385 --> 00:13:49,668
It's always spicy pork or pork cutlet.
I'm getting tired of it.

281
00:13:50,005 --> 00:13:52,288
Can't you treat us
to something good for once?

282
00:13:52,455 --> 00:13:53,660
Something expensive?

283
00:13:57,488 --> 00:13:58,488
Thanks!

284
00:13:58,716 --> 00:13:59,954
Go enjoy something expensive.

285
00:14:00,151 --> 00:14:01,151
Aren't you coming?

286
00:14:01,549 --> 00:14:02,549
I've got a date.

287
00:14:05,746 --> 00:14:07,993
All you do on dates is eat pasta anyway.

288
00:14:08,948 --> 00:14:09,948
What should we do?

289
00:14:10,123 --> 00:14:11,123
How about beef?

290
00:14:11,652 --> 00:14:13,498
Should we go all out today?

291
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:15,226
Why do you look so annoyed?

292
00:14:15,258 --> 00:14:16,359
Do you like Ji Ni...

293
00:14:17,305 --> 00:14:18,913
Are you trying to hit me where it hurts?

294
00:14:19,808 --> 00:14:21,496
- Let's go.
- Yeah, let's go.

295
00:14:22,930 --> 00:14:25,165
- What should we get? Beef?
- Beef it is.

296
00:14:31,898 --> 00:14:34,398
Did you make this, Ji Ni?

297
00:14:36,044 --> 00:14:39,388
I used to think this kind of thing
was cheesy, but here I am doing it.

298
00:14:40,092 --> 00:14:42,227
I've never done this for a man before.

299
00:14:42,252 --> 00:14:43,794
Not even for my dad.

300
00:14:45,365 --> 00:14:46,615
I'm honored.

301
00:14:55,152 --> 00:14:57,546
What's going on? What's the occasion?

302
00:14:57,789 --> 00:14:59,916
Did I do something right?
I feel like I won a prize.

303
00:15:01,151 --> 00:15:02,327
I'm surprised too.

304
00:15:02,452 --> 00:15:04,115
I never thought I'd be like this.

305
00:15:08,571 --> 00:15:09,891
Ji Ni, here.

306
00:15:16,505 --> 00:15:19,206
I'm unemployed these days,
so I'll do it for you now and then.

307
00:15:19,230 --> 00:15:20,319
I thought you were learning video editing.

308
00:15:20,344 --> 00:15:23,775
I'm looking into taking a course.

309
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,182
It's hard to learn on my own.

310
00:15:25,265 --> 00:15:27,048
You need good editing software.

311
00:15:27,158 --> 00:15:28,591
And a powerful computer.

312
00:15:29,128 --> 00:15:30,171
I'll buy you one.

313
00:15:32,435 --> 00:15:33,435
Thank you.

314
00:15:35,112 --> 00:15:37,856
Don't answer my mom's calls.

315
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:38,902
Isn't it exhausting?

316
00:15:38,926 --> 00:15:39,926
It's fine.

317
00:15:40,044 --> 00:15:41,441
I need to stay on her good side.

318
00:15:41,532 --> 00:15:42,881
I've got a lot to make up for.

319
00:15:43,643 --> 00:15:44,689
You're sweet.

320
00:15:45,012 --> 00:15:46,400
I don't even like my own mom.

321
00:15:47,032 --> 00:15:50,756
Mom invited you and Jung A
over to the house.

322
00:15:51,012 --> 00:15:53,400
She wants to see you,
but thought you might feel awkward,

323
00:15:53,424 --> 00:15:54,766
so she asked me to bring Jung A too.

324
00:15:55,353 --> 00:15:56,539
Jung A too?

325
00:15:57,316 --> 00:15:59,638
I told her I wanted to marry you.

326
00:16:00,384 --> 00:16:02,601
She asked if you felt the same way.

327
00:16:02,625 --> 00:16:04,025
When I said I wasn't sure,

328
00:16:04,469 --> 00:16:06,872
she said she'd like to spend some time
with you too.

329
00:16:09,858 --> 00:16:12,145
I'm not trying to pressure you.

330
00:16:12,219 --> 00:16:13,812
I can wait as long as it takes.

331
00:16:14,292 --> 00:16:17,920
I've been pushed into things
by circumstances and expectations before.

332
00:16:18,273 --> 00:16:19,273
It doesn't end well.

333
00:16:20,232 --> 00:16:21,297
You know how I feel, right?

334
00:16:30,158 --> 00:16:31,580
What do you think?

335
00:16:32,777 --> 00:16:34,208
That's what I don't know.

336
00:16:34,525 --> 00:16:36,774
I don't want to lose Ji Hu,

337
00:16:37,345 --> 00:16:40,115
but I don't know if I can handle
married life.

338
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:43,133
I don't feel ready. I'm still scared.

339
00:16:43,571 --> 00:16:46,257
Why do you think that?
What's wrong with you?

340
00:16:47,324 --> 00:16:50,051
Just seeing how my mom went after Ji Hu...

341
00:16:50,128 --> 00:16:51,804
was so embarrassing.

342
00:16:53,096 --> 00:16:55,043
He understands, so what's the problem?

343
00:16:55,135 --> 00:16:57,338
Your mom's pretty energetic, you know.

344
00:16:59,885 --> 00:17:01,036
Ma'am,

345
00:17:02,373 --> 00:17:06,151
do you think I'm cut out for marriage?

346
00:17:07,164 --> 00:17:11,674
Even the way Ji Hu's mom
looks at Jung A hurts me.

347
00:17:12,105 --> 00:17:13,105
Why?

348
00:17:14,178 --> 00:17:17,491
Jung A has both parents, a government job,

349
00:17:18,153 --> 00:17:20,371
and, most of all,
a normal family background on paper.

350
00:17:20,396 --> 00:17:22,065
My family background isn't normal.

351
00:17:22,685 --> 00:17:25,784
If Ji Hu's mom keeps rejecting me,

352
00:17:26,341 --> 00:17:28,341
I think I'll just want to run away.

353
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:30,767
I know what you mean.

354
00:17:30,825 --> 00:17:33,740
So whenever Ji Hu brings up marriage,

355
00:17:33,893 --> 00:17:35,826
the words get stuck in my throat.

356
00:17:35,851 --> 00:17:37,447
I can't say what I really want to say.

357
00:17:40,185 --> 00:17:43,304
No marriage is ever completely secure
or certain.

358
00:17:43,665 --> 00:17:45,513
None of us knows what tomorrow will bring.

359
00:17:46,452 --> 00:17:48,465
But from my experience,

360
00:17:49,175 --> 00:17:51,249
I don't think there are any failures
in life.

361
00:17:52,298 --> 00:17:57,233
Sometimes the path changes,
or you end up somewhere you didn't expect.

362
00:17:58,332 --> 00:18:01,081
Stop obsessing
over keeping everything safe.

363
00:18:02,490 --> 00:18:03,733
I can't.

364
00:18:04,203 --> 00:18:05,793
I'm so anxious.

365
00:18:07,012 --> 00:18:10,752
Did I ever tell you I dreamed
of being a musical theater actress?

366
00:18:11,485 --> 00:18:14,081
I wanted to soar across the stage,

367
00:18:14,314 --> 00:18:16,922
but then I suddenly got pregnant
with Seung Hyun and got married.

368
00:18:18,118 --> 00:18:20,224
I was so ashamed,

369
00:18:20,367 --> 00:18:22,767
and I felt like my whole life
had fallen apart.

370
00:18:23,365 --> 00:18:24,365
And on top of that,

371
00:18:25,395 --> 00:18:27,846
my marriage itself fell apart,

372
00:18:28,596 --> 00:18:31,618
and I felt like a complete failure.

373
00:18:32,248 --> 00:18:33,248
Ma'am.

374
00:18:33,278 --> 00:18:35,382
But even through all that failure,

375
00:18:35,605 --> 00:18:37,777
I met Seung Hyun and Seung Woo.

376
00:18:39,451 --> 00:18:42,722
Seung Woo still gives me trouble,

377
00:18:44,098 --> 00:18:47,813
but I'll always be grateful
I met those two boys.

378
00:18:49,492 --> 00:18:51,438
Can I just focus on Ji Hu and move on?

379
00:18:52,131 --> 00:18:54,141
I think that's okay.

380
00:18:54,852 --> 00:18:56,164
At least for today.

381
00:18:56,537 --> 00:18:57,837
Who knows about tomorrow?

382
00:18:58,149 --> 00:18:59,690
Don't expect any guarantees.

383
00:18:59,998 --> 00:19:02,474
No one can promise you that.

384
00:19:17,265 --> 00:19:18,531
Im Ji Hu, listen up!

385
00:19:18,596 --> 00:19:20,323
I've got good news for you.

386
00:19:20,618 --> 00:19:24,060
When you get off work,
come running straight to me.

387
00:19:24,084 --> 00:19:25,084
Got it?

388
00:19:26,525 --> 00:19:28,923
I told you to come, so just come.
Why all the questions?

389
00:19:30,152 --> 00:19:31,889
Hey, I told you I can't say it
over the phone.

390
00:19:33,792 --> 00:19:35,939
That brat never listens.

391
00:19:42,872 --> 00:19:45,000
Come by now and then to loosen up.

392
00:19:45,764 --> 00:19:48,837
I really hate the heat,
but I do feel refreshed.

393
00:19:49,074 --> 00:19:51,047
When you get home,

394
00:19:51,491 --> 00:19:54,600
check if Seung Woo is staying home
and let me know.

395
00:19:54,817 --> 00:19:56,417
Sure. You're worried
about him, aren't you?

396
00:19:56,442 --> 00:19:58,267
That frustrating boy.

397
00:19:59,752 --> 00:20:01,863
They're not really dating, are they?

398
00:20:02,105 --> 00:20:04,213
Maybe he just felt sorry
for her for a moment.

399
00:20:04,518 --> 00:20:06,350
As ridiculous as that sounds,

400
00:20:07,342 --> 00:20:09,278
he just had a momentary lapse, right?

401
00:20:09,942 --> 00:20:10,942
Of course.

402
00:20:11,153 --> 00:20:12,754
Jung A was on "Love in Zip" too,

403
00:20:12,778 --> 00:20:14,627
and she said she didn't sense anything
between those two.

404
00:20:14,651 --> 00:20:16,461
I certainly hope so.

405
00:20:16,545 --> 00:20:18,385
How does this make any sense?

406
00:20:28,512 --> 00:20:29,553
What did you say?

407
00:20:30,188 --> 00:20:31,679
I told you to apologize to Ji Ni.

408
00:20:31,709 --> 00:20:33,626
Properly. Sincerely.

409
00:20:34,310 --> 00:20:35,411
Are you crazy?

410
00:20:36,359 --> 00:20:39,264
You know how much I hate Ji Ni.
How can you say that?

411
00:20:39,712 --> 00:20:41,073
You said you'd talk to her.

412
00:20:41,532 --> 00:20:43,117
You said you'd beg her on my behalf.

413
00:20:43,142 --> 00:20:44,290
You jerk!

414
00:20:46,985 --> 00:20:48,937
What did you do when you locked Ji Ni
in the storage room?

415
00:20:49,272 --> 00:20:51,158
- Tell me yourself.
- The storage room?

416
00:20:52,472 --> 00:20:55,377
- Ji Hu got her out right away.
- Not that time.

417
00:20:56,174 --> 00:20:57,204
When you were in middle school.

418
00:21:01,392 --> 00:21:03,584
- I was just trying to scare her...
- Scare her?

419
00:21:04,637 --> 00:21:05,845
You call that scaring her?

420
00:21:06,705 --> 00:21:08,341
Why were you so cruel?

421
00:21:08,511 --> 00:21:11,131
Who are you to punish Ji Ni
because her mother had an affair?

422
00:21:11,391 --> 00:21:13,710
That's something our families
should settle. Who are you to...

423
00:21:14,843 --> 00:21:16,562
try to ruin Ji Ni's life over it?

424
00:21:17,265 --> 00:21:18,350
You really...

425
00:21:19,562 --> 00:21:20,704
were awful.

426
00:21:21,479 --> 00:21:22,675
So what?

427
00:21:23,672 --> 00:21:26,255
Her dad searched the whole school
and got her out. That was enough.

428
00:21:26,279 --> 00:21:27,279
What if he hadn't?

429
00:21:28,085 --> 00:21:29,192
What if he hadn't?

430
00:21:30,469 --> 00:21:32,268
You're the worst.

431
00:21:33,005 --> 00:21:34,909
Everything you have is yours,

432
00:21:35,224 --> 00:21:37,551
but you still want to take away
the one thing Ji Ni has.

433
00:21:37,695 --> 00:21:39,051
You're taking Ji Ni's side again?

434
00:21:39,741 --> 00:21:40,741
Again?

435
00:21:41,645 --> 00:21:43,223
This is driving me crazy.

436
00:21:43,956 --> 00:21:45,116
You said you were on my side.

437
00:21:45,672 --> 00:21:49,002
Both of us grew up with lousy fathers,

438
00:21:49,418 --> 00:21:51,494
and we've both been hurt
and left with so much missing,

439
00:21:51,644 --> 00:21:55,345
but that doesn't mean
we can give up on ourselves.

440
00:21:56,462 --> 00:21:57,550
Apologize.

441
00:21:58,011 --> 00:22:00,967
Apologize, then leave
with your head held high.

442
00:22:01,931 --> 00:22:04,144
Not for Ji Ni's sake. For yours.

443
00:22:04,804 --> 00:22:06,559
No matter how much you deny it,

444
00:22:06,928 --> 00:22:09,585
attempted murder, attempted rape...

445
00:22:10,165 --> 00:22:11,936
I said that's not true!

446
00:22:12,518 --> 00:22:14,598
And your dad covered all of it up.

447
00:22:15,452 --> 00:22:16,805
What a remarkable man.

448
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:19,024
Stop talking!

449
00:22:22,865 --> 00:22:23,962
I want you...

450
00:22:24,818 --> 00:22:26,349
to become a kinder person.

451
00:22:26,950 --> 00:22:27,950
I want...

452
00:22:29,241 --> 00:22:31,329
your mom to stop hitting you.

453
00:22:31,958 --> 00:22:33,916
I want you to live a decent life.

454
00:22:35,832 --> 00:22:38,330
College? You don't have to go.

455
00:22:38,671 --> 00:22:41,707
Painting?
It's okay if you're not good at it.

456
00:22:42,972 --> 00:22:45,149
Don't use other people
to prove your worth.

457
00:22:45,211 --> 00:22:46,321
You...

458
00:22:47,373 --> 00:22:49,002
can make a better life for yourself.

459
00:23:50,798 --> 00:23:52,042
We're out of rice cakes.

460
00:23:52,066 --> 00:23:53,918
We've closed for the day.

461
00:23:55,695 --> 00:23:57,141
Hello.

462
00:23:57,166 --> 00:24:01,373
My daughter said you'd moved back here.
So this is the place.

463
00:24:01,374 --> 00:24:02,375
Yes.

464
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:05,985
As I get older, I keep thinking about
where I used to live, so I came back.

465
00:24:05,986 --> 00:24:08,305
Good for you. It's a nice neighborhood.

466
00:24:08,725 --> 00:24:10,579
I'd like to order some rice cakes.

467
00:24:10,581 --> 00:24:12,840
The ones you gave me last time
were delicious.

468
00:24:13,272 --> 00:24:15,256
I'll have to become a regular.

469
00:24:15,281 --> 00:24:17,220
Thank you. What kind would you like?

470
00:24:17,485 --> 00:24:19,566
Anything. Whatever you make best.

471
00:24:19,725 --> 00:24:21,567
Then I'll prepare some steamed rice cake
with red beans.

472
00:24:21,592 --> 00:24:22,760
Okay.

473
00:24:24,448 --> 00:24:29,517
Remember when I told you that case...

474
00:24:29,519 --> 00:24:31,320
- had been closed?
- Yes.

475
00:24:31,522 --> 00:24:33,937
We still haven't found the culprit.

476
00:24:33,952 --> 00:24:35,152
Really?

477
00:24:35,177 --> 00:24:36,469
My son...

478
00:24:36,494 --> 00:24:40,149
has been handing out flyers everywhere
trying to find the culprit.

479
00:24:40,573 --> 00:24:44,257
He's so fixated on something
that happened over 20 years ago.

480
00:24:44,476 --> 00:24:46,921
As his mother, it breaks my heart.

481
00:24:47,192 --> 00:24:49,999
Even if he finds the culprit,
nothing will change.

482
00:24:50,086 --> 00:24:51,976
He's young. He should live his own life.

483
00:24:52,056 --> 00:24:54,309
He can't keep dwelling on the past.

484
00:24:54,333 --> 00:24:55,461
Don't you agree?

485
00:24:55,536 --> 00:24:56,742
That's true.

486
00:24:57,012 --> 00:24:58,705
So, here's what I wanted to ask.

487
00:24:58,707 --> 00:25:00,518
If you happen to see my son,

488
00:25:00,621 --> 00:25:04,538
I'd appreciate it if you didn't mention
Pumseongak or anything related to it.

489
00:25:04,644 --> 00:25:05,748
Don't worry.

490
00:25:05,772 --> 00:25:07,641
I understand exactly how you feel.

491
00:25:07,665 --> 00:25:09,601
Thank you.

492
00:25:10,032 --> 00:25:11,169
As for the rice cakes...

493
00:25:11,194 --> 00:25:12,766
I'll deliver them to your home tomorrow.

494
00:25:12,791 --> 00:25:15,287
No, I'll come pick them up.

495
00:25:15,325 --> 00:25:16,881
I'm taking them to my workplace.

496
00:25:16,906 --> 00:25:17,941
Okay, then.

497
00:25:18,045 --> 00:25:21,177
- Okay. Thank you.
- Take care.

498
00:25:43,085 --> 00:25:44,508
This is hard.

499
00:25:44,671 --> 00:25:45,774
What's hard?

500
00:25:48,385 --> 00:25:50,782
Video editing? Why are you doing this?

501
00:25:50,807 --> 00:25:52,820
I thought I'd learn
when I have some free time.

502
00:25:58,118 --> 00:25:59,341
Want me to teach you?

503
00:25:59,965 --> 00:26:00,965
You know how?

504
00:26:04,718 --> 00:26:06,036
Have you been drinking?

505
00:26:06,107 --> 00:26:07,983
Yeah, a little.

506
00:26:09,513 --> 00:26:10,513
Can you smell it?

507
00:26:13,778 --> 00:26:16,432
If you're learning this for animation,

508
00:26:16,456 --> 00:26:19,427
there's a much better program for that.

509
00:26:19,505 --> 00:26:20,986
So did I buy the wrong one?

510
00:26:21,011 --> 00:26:22,617
Hold on. Let me take a look.

511
00:26:42,132 --> 00:26:43,589
Why are you here again?

512
00:26:45,552 --> 00:26:47,714
Are you really dating Seung Woo?

513
00:26:48,271 --> 00:26:50,888
Does Seung Woo like you? Since when?

514
00:26:52,338 --> 00:26:53,338
No.

515
00:26:53,678 --> 00:26:55,399
He just feels sorry for me.

516
00:26:55,662 --> 00:26:56,966
He feels sorry for you?

517
00:26:57,049 --> 00:26:58,766
You've got to be kidding me.

518
00:26:59,298 --> 00:27:01,469
As if you're the most pitiful person
in the world.

519
00:27:02,238 --> 00:27:03,813
Please call Ji Ni for me.

520
00:27:04,165 --> 00:27:05,489
Why do you want Ji Ni?

521
00:27:05,832 --> 00:27:08,772
What are you planning to do
to my daughter this time?

522
00:27:10,142 --> 00:27:11,439
Ji Ni.

523
00:27:11,683 --> 00:27:12,907
Na Ji Ni!

524
00:27:13,370 --> 00:27:14,576
Come out!

525
00:27:17,291 --> 00:27:18,380
Na Ji Ni!

526
00:27:21,971 --> 00:27:23,144
What's going on?

527
00:27:25,187 --> 00:27:26,391
Why are you here?

528
00:27:30,587 --> 00:27:31,707
I'm sorry.

529
00:27:32,139 --> 00:27:33,459
I was wrong.

530
00:27:34,101 --> 00:27:36,739
Please talk to Ji Hu
so I can leave for England quietly.

531
00:27:36,817 --> 00:27:39,172
You...

532
00:27:39,545 --> 00:27:41,495
Even on your knees,
you're still being your usual self.

533
00:27:42,504 --> 00:27:44,233
No, Ji Ni. Don't forgive her.

534
00:27:44,405 --> 00:27:48,465
After all this, she thinks this act
makes up for everything?

535
00:27:48,558 --> 00:27:51,179
There's not an ounce of sincerity in it.

536
00:27:55,412 --> 00:27:56,940
You said he told you to apologize.

537
00:27:57,252 --> 00:27:58,437
That's why I'm here.

538
00:27:58,861 --> 00:28:01,358
Ji Hu said he won't let me leave
unless you agree.

539
00:28:02,230 --> 00:28:04,990
If it weren't for Ji Hu, you wouldn't
even want to apologize to me, would you?

540
00:28:05,242 --> 00:28:07,685
Of course not. Why even ask?

541
00:28:08,475 --> 00:28:10,499
Ji Ni, think about your dad.

542
00:28:10,654 --> 00:28:13,026
How much running around
has he done for you?

543
00:28:13,051 --> 00:28:14,936
Please stop bringing up the past.

544
00:28:16,039 --> 00:28:17,521
She came here to apologize.

545
00:28:17,890 --> 00:28:19,140
I was wrong.

546
00:28:19,532 --> 00:28:20,901
I'm truly sorry.

547
00:28:20,926 --> 00:28:21,961
That's enough!

548
00:28:48,568 --> 00:28:51,687
(Family Register)

549
00:28:51,771 --> 00:28:53,378
I'm sorry. I can't watch this anymore.

550
00:28:53,403 --> 00:28:55,483
What if I marry Seung Woo?

551
00:28:55,508 --> 00:28:56,509
We just click.

552
00:28:56,534 --> 00:28:57,792
Don't ever show your face again.

553
00:28:57,807 --> 00:28:59,067
That's grounds for divorce.

554
00:28:59,102 --> 00:29:00,568
We can't stay married like this.

555
00:29:00,593 --> 00:29:03,227
Yeong Ju, if you're married to me,
you should focus on me.

556
00:29:03,252 --> 00:29:05,772
Why are you pretending to be my mom
and silencing a witness?

557
00:29:05,797 --> 00:29:07,165
What are you really up to?

558
00:29:07,190 --> 00:29:10,378
What are you hiding that you'd go so far
as to claim you're my mom?

559
00:29:13,100 --> 00:29:15,100
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
